C-K1/K3: Tab order + focus indicator
(always apply at desktop — include unconditionally)
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
CSS required (add to <style>):
  /* Remove all positive tabindex in JS */
  /* Focus indicator — apply globally */
  :focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid #005FCC;
    outline-offset: 2px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  /* Suppress focus ring for mouse users only */
  :focus:not(:focus-visible) {
    outline: none;
  }

JS required:
  /* Remove any positive tabindex values left in the DOM */
  document.querySelectorAll('[tabindex]').forEach(el => {
    const val = parseInt(el.getAttribute('tabindex'), 10);
    if (val > 0) el.removeAttribute('tabindex');
  });

